vec-eq-ascribed-multi: pure-Turmeric body but depends transitively on stdlib inline-C
(vec/map/set ops and/or per-call-site eq?/option-eq?/result-eq? synthesis
that bottoms out in carrier-ABI inline-C helpers) which the tree-walking
interpreter cannot execute (eval: inline-C not supported in interpreter
mode). Passes the compiled path (bash tests/run.sh). The turi inline-C
carve-out (fixture_has_inline_c) only greps the fixture body for a ```c
block, so it does not catch the transitive dependency -- hence the explicit
marker. Tracked in docs/archive/monomorphization-wip-fixture-failures.md
(Group E).
